        </div>

        <div class="endpoint">
            <span class="method">GET</span>
            <span class="url">/api/cinemas/stats</span>
            <div class="description">获取影院统计信息</div>
            <div class="example">
                <strong>示例:</strong> GET /api/cinemas/stats
