        <div class="response">
            <h3>响应格式</h3>
            <p>所有接口都返回JSON格式，包含以下字段：</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>success:</strong> 布尔值，表示请求是否成功</li>
                <li><strong>data:</strong> 返回的数据</li>
                <li><strong>count:</strong> 数据条数（适用于列表接口）</li>
                <li><strong>message:</strong> 错误信息（当success为false时）</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <h2>👥 用户管理API接口</h2>
        
        <div class="endpoint">
            <span class="method">POST</span>
            <span class="url">/users/register</span>
            <div class="description">用户注册</div>
            <div class="example">
                <strong>示例:</strong> POST /users/register<br>
                <strong>请求体:</strong> { "username": "testuser", "password": "123456", "email": "test@example.com" }
            </div>
            <div class="test-section">
                <div class="input-group">
                    <label>用户名:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="user-username" value="testuser" placeholder="输入用户名">
                </div>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <label>密码:</label>
                    <input type="password" id="user-password" value="123456" placeholder="输入密码">
                </div>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <label>邮箱:</label>
                    <input type="email" id="user-email" value="test@example.com" placeholder="输入邮箱">
                </div>
                <button class="test-button" onclick="testUserEndpoint('register')">测试注册</button>
                <button class="clear-button" onclick="clearResult('user-register')">清除结果</button>
                <div id="result-user-register" class="result"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="endpoint">
